WEBVTT

00:00:59.480 --> 00:01:02.040
tell her you bought a ticket to the Bay.

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:05.056
Paso Robles road trip,

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:06.496
wine taste,

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:08.816
buy a Malbec and a tight red tee,

00:01:08.840 --> 00:01:11.616
eat a cookie from an LA dispensary,

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:15.296
chain-smoke around
bed and breakfast hillside fire pit

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:18.736
with San Diego newlyweds
and vineyard view.

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:20.176
(Laughter)

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:23.376
Go to the water with your girls

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:26.460
and grease-stained
bags of burgers.

00:01:26.510 --> 00:01:28.730
Sit on driftwood.

00:01:28.760 --> 00:01:30.160
Sunset.